#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:1
msgid "HistoryPanel 数据面板基础操作"
msgstr "HistoryPanel Basic operations of data panel"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:3
msgid "在完成前两章「入门」和「获取并管理金融数据」之后，我们已经可以："
msgstr ""
"After completing the first two chapters \"Getting Started\" and \"Obtaining "
"and Managing Financial Data\", we can already:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:5
msgid "在本地配置好数据源并下载所需的历史数据；"
msgstr ""
"Configure the data source locally and download the required historical data;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:6
msgid "使用 `get_history_data()` 或 `get_kline()` 获取价格、成交量等 **History** 行情。"
msgstr ""
"Use `get_history_data()` or `get_kline()` to get **History** quotes such as "
"price, trading volume, etc."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**边界**：`HistoryPanel` **只吃 History 形状**（时间 × 标的）。宏观、北向资金、`close-000300.SH` "
"这类 Reference 请用 `get_reference_data`（返回时间序列，不是面板的「第三维标的」）；行业、上市日等 Static 请用 "
"`get_static_data`。详见 [DataType 概念章](../manage_data/02.%20datatypes.md) 与 [教程"
" 2.0](2.0-get-data.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Boundary**: `HistoryPanel` **Only eat History shape** (time × target). "
"Please use `get_reference_data` for reference such as macro, northbound "
"funds, `close-000300.SH` (returns time series, not the \"third dimension "
"target\" of the panel); please use `get_static_data` for Static such as "
"industry, listing date, etc. For details, see [DataType Concept "
"Chapter](../manage_data/02.%20datatypes.md) and [Tutorial 2.0](2.0-get-"
"data.md)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:10
msgid ""
"接下来，我们将通过本篇及后续章节，重点介绍 `HistoryPanel` "
"对象的使用方法。我们将通过本章掌握**`HistoryPanel`**的基本属性与基本操作，再进入更加进阶的量化因子分析与可视化工作流。"
msgstr ""
"Next, we will focus on the use of the `HistoryPanel` object through this and"
" subsequent chapters. We will master the basic properties and basic "
"operations of **`HistoryPanel`** through this chapter, and then enter more "
"advanced quantitative factor analysis and visualization workflow."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:12
msgid ""
"**关于 `HistoryPanel`**：`HistoryPanel` 是 `qteasy` "
"提供的**三维历史数据容器**（它将不同投资标的（shares）在一段历史时期内（hdates）的多种不同历史数据指标(htypes)集中在一个三维ndarray中），提供众多API供取数之后统一管理、切片、扩列与对齐，以及金融统计分析。"
msgstr ""
"**About `HistoryPanel`**: `HistoryPanel` is a **three-dimensional historical"
" data container** provided by `qteasy` (it collects a variety of different "
"historical data indicators (htypes) of different investment targets (shares)"
" in a historical period (hdates) into a three-dimensional ndarray). It "
"provides numerous APIs for unified management, slicing, column expansion and"
" alignment after data retrieval, as well as financial statistical analysis."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:14
msgid "**本篇覆盖**："
msgstr "**This article covers**:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:15
msgid "创建面板并查看结构（`shape` / `shares` / `hdates` / `htypes`）；"
msgstr ""
"Create panels and view structures (`shape` / `shares` / `hdates` / "
"`htypes`);"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:16
msgid ""
"切片与筛选（推荐 `subpanel` / `loc` / 列访问；旧名 `slice` / `segment` / `isegment` "
"仍可用但已弃用）；"
msgstr ""
"Slicing and filtering (recommended `subpanel` / `loc` / column access; old "
"names `slice` / `segment` / `isegment` still available but deprecated);"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:17
msgid "用 `drop` / `rename` 删除或重命名标的与指标标签；"
msgstr ""
"Use `drop` / `rename` to delete or rename the target and indicator labels;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:18
msgid "列读写与 `assign` 扩列，以及简单列表达式 `expr`；"
msgstr ""
"Column reading and writing and column expansion with `assign`, and simple "
"column expressions `expr`;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:19
msgid "缺失填充（`ffill` / `bfill` / `dropna`）与可变性约定；"
msgstr ""
"Missing padding (`ffill` / `bfill` / `dropna`) and mutability conventions;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:20
msgid "`align_to` 对齐两块面板；"
msgstr "`align_to` Align two panels;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:21
msgid "与 `DataFrame` 互转。"
msgstr "Convert to `DataFrame`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:23
msgid ""
"**注**：收益率、K 线指标、`where` 掩码、组合粗验、完整回测等见 [使用 HistoryPanel "
"操作和分析历史数据](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md)；完整回测交给 `Operator` / "
"`Backtester`，迁移路径见 [从 HistoryPanel 研究到 Strategy / "
"Operator](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#从-historypanel-研究到-strategy--"
"operator迁移路径)。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**: For the rate of return, K-line indicator, `where` mask, "
"combination rough test, complete backtest, etc., see [Use HistoryPanel to "
"operate and analyze historical data] (2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md); "
"the complete backtest is handed over to `Operator` / `Backtester`, and the "
"migration path can be found in [From HistoryPanel Research to Strategy / "
"Operator](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md# Migration path from "
"-historypanel-research to -strategy--operator)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:25
msgid ""
"更完整的 API 说明可参考 [HistoryPanel API 参考](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)（含「列属性访问、比较与 "
"``loc``」与 ``where`` 专节）。"
msgstr ""
"For a more complete API description, please refer to [HistoryPanel API "
"Reference](../api/HistoryPanel.rst) (including the \"Column attribute "
"access, comparison and ``loc``」与 ``where`` section)."

