#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:78
msgid ""
"`hp.shape` 返回 **`(M, L, N)`**，分别对应 **股票数 × 时间长度 × "
"数据类型数**，与上表顺序一致。可以把它理解为：许多张「时间 × "
"指标」的二维表，在**标的**方向上再叠一层；同一面板内，各标的、各指标在时间上是对齐的。"
msgstr ""
"`hp.shape` returns **`(M, L, N)`**, corresponding to **number of stocks × "
"length of time × number of data types**, which is consistent with the order "
"in the above table. It can be understood as: many two-dimensional tables of "
"\"time × indicator\", stacked one layer in the direction of the target; in "
"the same panel, each target and each indicator is aligned in time."

