#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:131
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**方式 A**（与 §0 相同）：`qt.get_kline` 是面向标准 OHLCV 的语法糖，便于快速拿到 K 线面板。`qteasy` "
"还内置了一千余种 DataType（如 `pe` / `pb` / `eps`），需要这些 **History** 字段时请用路径 B 的 "
"`get_history_data`。宏观与截面属性不要塞进面板——分别用 `get_reference_data` / "
"`get_static_data`。数据类型概念、精选表与完整清单见 "
"[DataType](../manage_data/02.%20datatypes.md) 与 "
"[内置清单](../references/datatypes/index.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Method A** (same as §0): `qt.get_kline` is syntactic sugar for standard "
"OHLCV, making it easy to get the K-line panel quickly. `qteasy` also has "
"more than a thousand built-in DataType (such as `pe` / `pb` / `eps`). Please"
" use `get_history_data` of path B when you need these **History** fields. "
"Don’t cram macro and cross-sectional properties into the panel – use "
"`get_reference_data` / `get_static_data` respectively. Data type concepts, "
"selected tables and a complete list can be found in "
"[DataType](../manage_data/02.%20datatypes.md) and [Built-in "
"List](../references/datatypes/index.md)."

