#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:243
msgid ""
"关于 `hp.loc`：它**只沿时间（hdates）轴**筛选，等价 `hp[:, :, key]`。格点条件（例如「收盘价 > 某阈值」）请用 "
"`where` 生成 bool 掩码，再交给带 `mask=` 的研究接口——详见 [生成研究用 bool 掩码](2.5-historypanel-"
"data-analysis.md#生成研究用-bool-掩码where)。"
msgstr ""
"About `hp.loc`: It only filters along the time (hdates) axis, which is "
"equivalent to `hp[:, :, key]`. For grid conditions (such as \"closing price "
"> a certain threshold\"), please use `where` to generate a bool mask, and "
"then submit it to the research interface with `mask=` - for details, see "
"[Generate bool mask for research] (2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md#Generate bool-mask for research where)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:245
msgid ""
"**兼容别名（已弃用）**：`slice` / `segment` / `isegment` 仍可用，但会发出英文 "
"`DeprecationWarning`。新代码请改用上表推荐 API（`slice` → `subpanel`；`segment` → `loc` /"
" `subpanel(hdates=...)`；`isegment` → `hp[:, :, start:end]` / "
"`subpanel`）。绘图请用 `plot`；旧名 `candle` 已弃用并委托 `plot`。"
msgstr ""
"**Compatible aliases (deprecated)**: `slice` / `segment` / `isegment` still "
"work, but will emit English `DeprecationWarning`. For new codes, please use "
"the recommended APIs in the table above (`slice` → `subpanel`; `segment` → "
"`loc` / `subpanel(hdates=...)`; `isegment` → `hp[:, :, start:end]` / "
"`subpanel`). Please use `plot` for drawing; the old name `candle` has been "
"deprecated in favor of `plot`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:249
msgid "删除与重命名标签：`drop` / `rename`"
msgstr "Delete and rename tags: `drop` / `rename`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:251
msgid ""
"当您需要从面板中拿掉某些指标/标的，或把列名改成更短的研究名时，使用 `drop` / "
"`rename`。二者均返回**新**面板，不修改原对象，也不改写 `hdates`。"
msgstr ""
"Use `drop` / `rename` when you need to remove certain indicators/targets "
"from the panel, or change the column names to shorter study names. Both "
"return to the **new** panel without modifying the original object or "
"overwriting `hdates`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:267
msgid ""
"**提示**：`re_label` 是**原地**整轴重赋（保留旧 API）；日常「只改几个名字」请优先 `rename`。更多签名见 "
"[HistoryPanel API：drop / rename](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)。"
msgstr ""
"**Tip**: `re_label` is an **in-place** reassignment of the entire axis "
"(retaining the old API); for daily \"only changing a few names\", please "
"give priority to `rename`. See [HistoryPanel API: "
"drop/rename](../api/HistoryPanel.rst) for more signatures."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:271
msgid "列访问、写入与 `assign` 扩列"
msgstr "Column access, writing and `assign` column expansion"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:273
msgid "除了读取已有列，研究中经常需要**写入**或**派生**新列（价差、比值等）。"
msgstr ""
"In addition to reading existing columns, research often requires writing or "
"deriving new columns (spreads, ratios, etc.)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:275
msgid "**只读访问**："
msgstr "**Read Only Access**:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:277
msgid "列名为合法 Python 标识符时：`hp.close` 等价于 `hp['close']`；"
msgstr ""
"When the column name is a legal Python identifier: `hp.close` is equivalent "
"to `hp['close']`;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:278
msgid "复权列名含 `|`（如 `close|b`）时，须用方括号：`hp['close|b']`。"
msgstr ""
"When the restoration listing name contains `|` (such as `close|b`), square "
"brackets must be used: `hp['close|b']`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:280
msgid "**写入 / 覆盖**（原地修改当前面板）："
msgstr "**Write/Overwrite** (modify the current panel in place):"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:290
msgid "**`assign`：一次派生多列**（默认返回新面板）："
msgstr ""
"**`assign`: Derive multiple columns at once** (returns to new panel by "
"default):"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:307
msgid ""
"**注意**：`assign` 对已有列名采用「覆盖」语义。技术指标（均线、MACD 等）的扩列请使用 `hp.kline.*`，见 [叠加 K "
"线技术指标](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#叠加-k-线技术指标)；更完整的 `assign` 示例亦见该篇「在 "
"HistoryPanel 中派生新列」一节。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**: `assign` uses \"overwrite\" semantics for existing column names. "
"For expanded columns of technical indicators (moving averages, MACD, etc.), "
"please use `hp.kline.*`, see [Superimposed K-line Technical "
"Indicators](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#Superimposed-k-line Technical "
"Indicators); for a more complete `assign` example, please also see the "
"section \"Deriving New Columns in HistoryPanel\" in this article."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:309
msgid "**`expr`：简单列名算术**（默认返回新面板）："
msgstr ""
"**`expr`: Simple column name arithmetic** (default returns to new panel):"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:311
msgid "当新列只是现有 **identifier** 列名的加减乘除时，可用更短的 `expr`："
msgstr ""
"When the new column is just the addition, subtraction, multiplication, and "
"division of existing **identifier** column names, a shorter `expr` can be "
"used:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:319
msgid ""
"**提示**：复权列名含 `|`（如 `close|b`）时，`expr` 无法解析，请继续用 `assign` 或 "
"`hp['close|b']`。时序位移、`pct_change`、缺失清洗等见 [时序变换与缺失处理](2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md#时序变换与缺失处理shift--diff--pct_change--dropna)。"
msgstr ""
"**Tip**: When the restoration column name contains `|` (such as `close|b`), "
"`expr` cannot be parsed, please continue to use `assign` or `hp['close|b']`."
" For time series displacement, `pct_change`, missing cleaning, etc., see "
"[Timing Series Transformation and Missing Processing] (2.5-historypanel-"
"data-analysis.md# Timing Series Transformation and Missing Processing shift"
"--diff--pct_change--dropna)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:323
msgid "两块面板对齐：`align_to` 与合并前纪律"
msgstr "Alignment of two panels: `align_to` with pre-merge discipline"

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:325
msgid ""
"当您手里有两块 `HistoryPanel`（例如不同时间拉取、或不同股票池），想做逐元素运算时，需要特别注意：直接对 `.values` 做 "
"NumPy 运算**不会**自动对齐 `shares` 与 `hdates`，可能出现「看起来能算、其实错行」的 silent bug。"
msgstr ""
"When you have two pieces of `HistoryPanel` (for example, pulled at different"
" times, or from different stock pools) and want to perform element-by-"
"element operations, you need to pay special attention: directly performing "
"NumPy operations on `.values` will not automatically align `shares` and "
"`hdates`, and there may be a silent bug that \"appears to be calculated, but"
" is actually wrong.\""

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:327
msgid "因此建议固定流程：**先对齐，再计算**。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, it is recommended to fix the process: **Align first, then "
"calculate**."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:354
msgid ""
"**提示**：多表拼 `close` + `pb`、手工同构列名等见 [多源数据拼成 HistoryPanel](2.5-historypanel-"
"data-analysis.md#多源数据拼成-historypanel价格--基本面示例)；日线升周线等频率转换见该篇「对齐与重采样」相关小节。"
msgstr ""
"**Tip**: For multi-table spelling `close` + `pb`, manual isomorphic column "
"names, etc., please see [Multiple source data spelling "
"HistoryPanel](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#Multiple source data "
"spelling-historypanel price--fundamental example); for frequency conversion "
"such as daily rising and weekly lines, please see the relevant section of "
"\"Alignment and Resampling\" of this article."

