#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:377
msgid ""
"**兼容别名（仍可用，行为不变）**：`unstack` ≡ `to_df_dict`；`flatten` / "
"`flatten_to_dataframe` ≡ `to_multi_index_dataframe`。新代码请写推荐名。"
msgstr ""
"**Compatible aliases (still available, behavior unchanged)**: `unstack` ≡ "
"`to_df_dict`; `flatten` / `flatten_to_dataframe` ≡ "
"`to_multi_index_dataframe`. Please write the recommended name for the new "
"code."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:379
msgid ""
"在 `DataFrame` 上完成分析后，若要把结果写回面板：可用 `assign` / `__setitem__` 把 `(M, L)` "
"数组写回，或重新 `get_kline` / `get_history_data` 取数后再派生。"
msgstr ""
"After completing the analysis on `DataFrame`, if you want to write the "
"results back to the panel: You can use `assign` / `__setitem__` to write "
"back the `(M, L)` array, or re-fetch the `get_kline` / `get_history_data` "
"and then derive it."

#: ../../source/tutorials/2.4-historypanel-basics.md:381
msgid ""
"**提示**：发表级截面回归、长表导出等见 [导出到 pandas / statsmodels](2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md#导出到-pandas--statsmodels宽表长表与截面回归)。"
msgstr ""
"**Tip**: For publication-level cross-sectional regression, long table "
"export, etc., see [Export to pandas/statsmodels](2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md#Export to-pandas--statsmodels wide table long table and cross-"
"sectional regression)."

